          "repeatable": false,
          "description": "A machine only: also run its module's delete.sh, taking the Site's side of it down (a satellite: OPNsense peer, tunnel, edge rules). Without it a machine is only unregistered; the machine itself is never touched (ADR-010 §8.4.5)."
        },
        {
